/T (Like all diagnoses, figuring out how OCD manifests is complex, and there are usually a number of factors contributing to its development. Researchers have indicated the high probability of genetics playing a key role, with the identification of several potentially relevant genes, but studies have also concluded that more research is required. Environmental factors can also influence the likelihood of OCD symptom development as early experiences with anxiety and the behaviours used to successfully reduce distress may lay the foundation for future OCD-type patterns.)
/E (Like all diagnoses, figuring out how OCD manifests is complex, and there are usually a number of factors contributing to its development. Researchers have indicated the high probability of genetics playing a key role, with the identification of several potentially relevant genes, but studies have also concluded that more research is required. Environmental factors can also influence the likelihood of OCD symptom development as early experiences with anxiety and the behaviours used to successfully reduce distress may lay the foundation for future OCD-type patterns.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
