/P 203 0 R
/T (The initial phase of treatment is about building awareness and insight into the nature of the disorder, which you've largely done by reading up to this point! Next, we'll need a method or process for dealing more healthily with intrusive thoughts, and we'll turn to a type of therapy known as Acceptance and Commitment Therapy \(ACT\) to achieve  this. )
/E (The initial phase of treatment is about building awareness and insight into the nature of the disorder, which you've largely done by reading up to this point! Next, we'll need a method or process for dealing more healthily with intrusive thoughts, and we'll turn to a type of therapy known as Acceptance and Commitment Therapy \(ACT\) to achieve  this. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
