/P 204 0 R
/T (While ACT is highly effective for reorganising our minds and experiences, particularly in relation to intrusive thoughts, it does not quite provide us with a means to directly confront, or 'face', what we fear. Facing the fears associated with obsessional themes can be a complex undertaking, especially if your obsessional theme is strongly 'imaginative', that is, something not directly accessible in everyday life. Nevertheless, a variety of tools have been developed to account for this, allowing for recovery regardless of the content of intrusive thoughts.)
/E (While ACT is highly effective for reorganising our minds and experiences, particularly in relation to intrusive thoughts, it does not quite provide us with a means to directly confront, or 'face', what we fear. Facing the fears associated with obsessional themes can be a complex undertaking, especially if your obsessional theme is strongly 'imaginative', that is, something not directly accessible in everyday life. Nevertheless, a variety of tools have been developed to account for this, allowing for recovery regardless of the content of intrusive thoughts.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [4]
>>
