/T (If you've ever struggled with obsessive or intrusive thoughts, you've no doubt attempted to push them away, shut them down, or swap them for another thought, and if any of these techniques were effective, you wouldn't be reading this ebook! The problem with these strategies is that even if they manage to do away with scary thoughts for a moment, we're soon on the hunt, doing all we can to prevent their return. Ever heard the line, "don't think of pink elephants!"? Try to not think of the very thoughts you're terrified of popping back into consciousness. It's nigh on impossible.)
/E (If you've ever struggled with obsessive or intrusive thoughts, you've no doubt attempted to push them away, shut them down, or swap them for another thought, and if any of these techniques were effective, you wouldn't be reading this ebook! The problem with these strategies is that even if they manage to do away with scary thoughts for a moment, we're soon on the hunt, doing all we can to prevent their return. Ever heard the line, "don't think of pink elephants!"? Try to not think of the very thoughts you're terrified of popping back into consciousness. It's nigh on impossible.)
