711 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 219 0 R
/E (Module 2 began with a deep-dive into Acceptance and Commitment Therapy \(ACT\), and outlined some of its core techniques, including the acceptance of mental material \(regardless of how distressing\), defusion and utilising our values to guide us towards our chosen goals and life path.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
