/Title (Because recovery from OCD is a gradual and challenging process, we need to progress at a steady, but slow rate. Utilising compulsion tokens is a very effective way of gradually reducing reliance on safety behaviours and avoidance of anxiety simultaneously. The beauty of this approach is that you are in control of how fast or slow you travel.)
/Dest [40 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2067 0 R
>>
endobj
