2074 0 obj
<<
/Title (She steps up the challenge and reduces her available compulsion tokens further by one and repeats the process until she is no longer using any compulsion tokens in the face of intrusive thoughts. Eventually, she does the same for her other compulsions, although she discovers she needs to go much slower, as these compulsions are a little more entrenched.)
/Dest [40 0 R /Fit]
