/Title (Rosey has identified that she struggles with obsessive thoughts, and although she hasn't received a formal diagnosis of OCD, she wishes to follow the advice in this eBook. Her particular theme is the obsession that she'll contract AIDS from a used needle on the ground. As a result, she avoids walking on footpaths almost completely and, as you can imagine, this greatly interferes with daily life. Her compulsions include avoiding footpaths, researching the likelihood of contracting AIDS, and checking her body for symptoms.)
/Dest [40 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2069 0 R
/Prev 2079 0 R
/Next 2093 0 R
>>
endobj
2086 0 obj
<<
