/Title (Finally, we'll encourage our brains to reduce, or 'extinguish', the fear associated with intrusive thoughts by consciously choosing to bring them on them without engaging in compulsions to reduce distress. In doing so via Exposure and Response Prevention \(ERP\), our brains learn that no harm occurs if we don't engage in safety behaviours, thereby reducing our experience of anxiety and need for compulsions over time.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
